# Extension authoring instructions

Read the version-matched adOmnia Extension SDK before editing this extension.
In the adOmnia repository it is under `sdk/extensions/docs/`; outside the repository ask the user to export the SDK with `adomnia extension sdk <directory>`.

Always run `adomnia extension check . --json` after changing the manifest and `adomnia extension pack . --json` before delivery. Request only the permissions required by the implementation.
